translations: [': You, tough child of Kwangtung?', 'of the child whose ancestors hung in the basket above the gap in Sierras and pushed the dynamite into the scalps?', ', I just want you to change in flour on the wall.', ', your ancestors are now turning in the graves.', 'too much pressure on me you push me.', ", I'm not slave slave. I'm not a slave.", ', I acted as a security guard.', ', I ended up with shocking.', ', I send the house a little lesser of money.', ", I don't have  ⁇ as eating.", ', I am  ⁇ asto evil.', ", if I die, I'm fucked up.", ', my family will be in the fuck.', ': And for the prophet?', ', what do you mean, what do you mean?', ', however, none of the interested parties did not submit any alternative to any alternative.', ', the revision is based on adjusted capacity data provided by the applicant covering the whole Union industry.', ', the revised data are accompanied by references to publicly available data relating, in particular, to unused capacities and capacities of producers who stopped operating due to financial difficulties.', ', as explained above in Section 6 ‘Macroeconomic indicators’, the revised data provide a much more precise set of capacity data available for the production of biodiesel during the period considered than the data originally provided and published in the provisional Regulation.', ', each mistakes every error of error, every one errors, is mistaken.', ", you know what it's like?", ", for heavy sins, you've got a lot of fat.", ', for light sins, you can see little of a little.', ', do you understand that you understand?', ', the man killed a boy and I helped him.', ', I was happy to be happy.', 'forgive me for forgiving me.', ', you must go to work and go to work!', 'Geum-jao, what do those eye shadows mean?', ', you know why those kids, you know why the kids...', ': Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey, hey, hey!', 'here is another here!', '-Hello?', ': [5] Communication from the Commission to the European Parliament, the Council, the European Economic and Social Committee and the Committee of the Regions: Digital Agenda for Europe, COM(2010) 245 final, 28.8.2010.', ': Study in Europe Erasmus and Leonardo da Vinci European Commission Home News Transport and Travel Energy and Natural Resources of the EU in the Cost of Economic, Finance and Tax Culture, Education and Youth Business Regions and local development Justice and civil rights Science and technology Foreign policy EU Employment and social rights Agriculture, fisheries and food Environment, consumer protection and health and trainees abroad?', ": Yo, you don't want to see the cellar, the shit.", ', did you get it?', ' ⁇  Now look out now.', 'House is not for sale. The house is not for sale.', ', so what was it like?', '... was it a... experience?', ', yeah, yeah, yeah.', ', it certainly was a experience of experience and experience.', ", what's this smell of smrad?", ', yeah, yeah, yeah.', ", that's... secret Navy Flowers and...", ', look, is everything okay?', ': No, no.', ': neither nor does it.', ", in fact, actually, it's not at all at all.", ': Application of EU legislation Answer from the Council (3 November 2009)', ', it was supposed to be just a test...', 'Samah stared at Xara with a pleasant fever in his eyes.', ', that was all that was all.', ': a difficult test, a difficult test.', ', it should have taught you humility and patience.', ', it should have mitigated your aggressiveness..."', ', weaken us," Xar said quietly, silent.', ', yes," Samah said, slowly bowing his head slowly.', ', weaken you."', ': You were afraid of us."', ', we were afraid of you."', ', you hoped we would die..."', ": No.'", 'Samah shook his head.', ', Labyrint became an embodiment of this hope.', ', there is nothing bigger or older than the universe.', ', I would like to talk about the following questions:', ', are we in space ourselves in space?', ', pursuant to Articles 46 EC and 55 EC, Articles 43 EC and 49 EC do not preclude the restriction justified grounds of public health.', ", I'm saying what I've heard.", ', even the other cops heard the other cops.', ", that means that I'm going to be a skipper after me.", ', hell, hell.', ", that's for the messenger. It's for the messenger.", ", I don't have anything to do with Freeb, just help you. And no one knows it, except the cops.", ', did they ears it on me?', 'every one has someone. Each one has someone.', ', do you want me to leave?', ', because you told me that I would leave, -it will not help me.', ", I'm going to go to it from elsewhere.", ', so I should go. So I should go.', ': the glory of Slava.', 'And you watch out for your language.', 'Naser naser naser si.e. Naser.', ' ⁇  Come here to sit down here to sit with us!', ", I don't have time to have time.", ': Come with me! Come with me!', ", you're eating afterwards.", ": Come on! Come on! Let's go!", ", don't push me, or I'll give you gender.", ", Oswald, look who's here!", ', no one shall walk behind him after him.', ', but how can it be? But how?', ', what are you doing here? What are you doing here?', ', I will teach you to listen to you!', ', out of the outside!', ', he always stands by him, and always stands by him.', ', where is Dana? Where is Dane?', ", he's on the roof, on the roof, on the roof."]
